  "label": "Stereotype of Jewish physical appearance (long beard, top hat)",
  "description": "A visual antisemitic trope that uses exaggerated or stereotypical physical features (long grey beard, top hat, fur hat) to caricature Jewish people. These features are not accurate representations but are used to visually identify and dehumanize Jewish individuals in a derogatory manner, as seen in the two caricatures in the image.",
